  "body": "Support 2D cutter radius compensation (`G41`, `G42`, `G40`) in `camcraft-gcode` for external NC simulation.\n\n## Scope\n- Expand `G41` (left) and `G42` (right) part contours to cutter-center `cl::Move` paths using the bound tool radius or wear register (`D`), following RS-274/ISO 6983 and `crates/cl/src/cl/comp.rs`.\n- Handle linear startup (`G41`/`G42`), arc and line corner intersections/transitions, and linear cancel (`G40`) blocks.\n- Refuse non-linear engage/cancel blocks, compensation changes inside canned cycles, or `G18`/`G19` arcs while compensation is active with the 1-based line number (`assets/posts/fanuc.cps`).\n\nDepends on #2217 and #2218.\n\nDone means: Tests expand CamCraft's `contour_control_comp.nc` golden to cutter center within tolerance, match `Dexel` stock removal against the uncompensated path, and refuse invalid `G41`/`G42`/`G40` transitions by line number.\n\nPart of #2213\n",
